<h2 id="heading-cards">Heading cards</h2>

A heading card names a group of cards on a dashboard. The Civica theme sets its title in the card heading style: 24px bold, line height 1.25. This keeps a section title as strong as the cards under it.

```yaml
type: heading
heading: Living room
heading_style: title
```

Use `heading_style: subtitle` for a smaller heading inside a group, such as “Lamps” under “Living room”. Subtitles keep their native supporting style.

```yaml
type: heading
heading: Lamps
heading_style: subtitle
```

[Type scale](typography-type-scale.html) gives the size of every heading on wide and narrow screens.
